/target
**/target
Cargo.lock
!/Cargo.lock
.DS_Store
dump.rdb

# Your own lesson progress, written by the web UI (`cargo run -p course-ui`).
# Deliberately not committed so every learner starts from a clean slate —
# see docs/adr/0001-web-ui-progress-state.md.
.course-progress.json

# Your own checkpoint answers, written by the web UI's editor — one Markdown
# file per lesson. Gitignored for the same reason as the progress file: they're
# yours, not curriculum. Delete the directory to start over, or commit it in
# your own fork if you'd rather keep them.
.checkpoint-answers/
